  "ingredients": [
    "1 pound ground chuck",
    "1 white onion, diced",
    "2 chipotle chili peppers in adobo sauce, minced",
    "2 cloves garlic, minced",
    "3 (8 ounce) cans tomato sauce",
    "1 teaspoon chili powder",
    "12 hot dogs",
    "1 tablespoon butter, or as needed",
    "12 hot dog buns",
    "shredded Cheddar cheese",
    "white onion"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zCG8UGUlcOGdQfsvNgaUlvIZn64=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/274404-chipotle-chili-dogs-VAT-006-step-01-8c339d1dabaa4d7483a07dbc095f7cca.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/274404/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook ground chuck, 1 diced onion, chipotles, and garlic in a medium saucepan over medium heat until beef is browned and crumbly, about 5 minutes. Drain grease from pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DGSZb0kAMADhSi_NB8AHKzigDb4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/274404-chipotle-chili-dogs-VAT-007-step-02-0fe86973b653482080a68092b1242b97.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/274404/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir tomato sauce and chili powder into beef mixture; bring to a boil. Reduce heat to low; simmer, stirring occasionally, 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MBUTK5FCeKD80wjt1FmPH1ol_Rw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/274404-chipotle-chili-dogs-VAT-008-step-03-97fb972eef9646a6a3876396aead691b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/274404/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, bring a saucepan of water to a boil. Add hot dogs; cook until plump and heated through, 4 to 6 minutes, or according to package directions.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ztmsG-AGWfNByZa7t0gpCIEcA7s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/274404-chipotle-chili-dogs-VAT-009-step-04-79f07fe9e3b544be993f22003e39d13b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/274404/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Butter hot dog buns and toast in a toaster oven, about 2 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CPRXUg6bEGgukqzikK6eGbGhSNc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/274404-chipotle-chili-dogs-VAT-010-step-05-18760ccc1e584629ba6f9000e33d0eeb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/274404/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place hot dogs in buns; spoon chili over top. Top with Cheddar cheese and 2 tablespoons diced onions.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7C43WIuUy92GY_1E6YFuvnSpJZ4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/274404-chipotle-chili-dogs-VAT-011-step-06-fc490941022e43c8b2aef5d23793b669.jpg"
      ],
